<div class="hgroup pagewide"><h1 class="title"><span class="title">Multitasking settings</span></h1></div>
<div class="region">
<div class="contents pagewide">
<p class="p">The Multitasking settings allow you to customize how you manage
  multiple tasks and group them into workspaces on your system. You can
  enable or disable the Shell's <span class="gui">Hot Corner</span> behavior and
  screen-edge resizing.</p>
<p class="p">You can use the settings to choose the number of workspaces you
  want and configure how they behave across multiple monitors. You can
  also choose whether the app switcher shows apps from all workspaces or
  only the current one.</p>
<div class="links topiclinks"><div class="inner"><div class="region"><div class="links-divs">
<div class="linkdiv "><a class="linkdiv" href="multitasking-app-switching.html.zh-CN" title="Customize app switching behavior"><span class="title">Customize app switching behavior</span><span class="linkdiv-dash"> — </span><span class="desc">Control which applications appear when switching between
    windows.</span></a></div>
<div class="linkdiv "><a class="linkdiv" href="multitasking-workspace-behavior.html.zh-CN" title="Customize workspace behavior"><span class="title">Customize workspace behavior</span><span class="linkdiv-dash"> — </span><span class="desc">Choose between dynamic workspaces that automatically adjust
    based on usage or a fixed number of workspaces. Also, configure how
    workspaces appear across multiple monitors.</span></a></div>
<div class="linkdiv "><a class="linkdiv" href="multitasking-hot-corner.html.zh-CN" title="Enable or disable Hot Corner"><span class="title">Enable or disable Hot Corner</span><span class="linkdiv-dash"> — </span><span class="desc">Configure your system to quickly access the
    Activities overview from the top-left corner of the screen.</span></a></div>
<div class="linkdiv "><a class="linkdiv" href="multitasking-screen-edges.html.zh-CN" title="Enable or disable window resizing at screen edges"><span class="title">Enable or disable window resizing at screen edges</span><span class="linkdiv-dash"> — </span><span class="desc">Control whether windows automatically resize when dragged
    to screen edges.</span></a></div>
</div></div></div></div>
</div>
